%% Sanitizer Detection Flow
%% Shows how sanitizers detect and report security vulnerabilities

flowchart TB
    Start[Application Code Execution] --> Monitor[Sanitizer Hooks Active]
    
    Monitor --> DB[Database Operation?]
    Monitor --> File[File System Operation?]
    Monitor --> Net[Network Operation?]
    Monitor --> Cmd[Command Execution?]
    Monitor --> Deser[Deserialization?]
    
    DB --> SQLCheck{Contains Untrusted<br/>Input?}
    SQLCheck -->|Yes| SQLValidate{Valid SQL<br/>Syntax?}
    SQLValidate -->|No + Exception| SQLReport[🚨 SQL Injection<br/>Detected]
    SQLValidate -->|Yes| SQLPass[✅ Safe]
    SQLCheck -->|No| SQLPass
    
    File --> PathCheck{Path Contains<br/>Traversal?}
    PathCheck -->|Yes| PathDanger{Escapes Allowed<br/>Directory?}
    PathDanger -->|Yes| PathReport[🚨 Path Traversal<br/>Detected]
    PathDanger -->|No| PathPass[✅ Safe]
    PathCheck -->|No| PathPass
    
    Net --> NetCheck{Connection to<br/>Internal Resource?}
    NetCheck -->|Yes| NetAllow{Connection<br/>Permitted?}
    NetAllow -->|No| NetReport[🚨 SSRF<br/>Detected]
    NetAllow -->|Yes| NetPass[✅ Safe]
    NetCheck -->|No| NetPass
    
    Cmd --> CmdCheck{Contains User<br/>Input?}
    CmdCheck -->|Yes| CmdDanger{Dangerous<br/>Characters?}
    CmdDanger -->|Yes| CmdReport[🚨 Command Injection<br/>Detected]
    CmdDanger -->|No| CmdPass[✅ Safe]
    CmdCheck -->|No| CmdPass
    
    Deser --> DeserCheck{Deserialization of<br/>Untrusted Data?}
    DeserCheck -->|Yes| DeserDanger{Gadget Chain<br/>Detected?}
    DeserDanger -->|Yes| DeserReport[🚨 Deserialization<br/>Vulnerability]
    DeserDanger -->|No| DeserPass[✅ Safe]
    DeserCheck -->|No| DeserPass
    
    SQLReport --> ReportFinding[Generate Finding Report]
    PathReport --> ReportFinding
    NetReport --> ReportFinding
    CmdReport --> ReportFinding
    DeserReport --> ReportFinding
    
    ReportFinding --> SaveInput[Save Crash Input]
    SaveInput --> StopTest[Stop Test Execution]
    
    SQLPass --> Continue[Continue Execution]
    PathPass --> Continue
    NetPass --> Continue
    CmdPass --> Continue
    DeserPass --> Continue
    
    Continue --> Done[Test Completes]
    StopTest --> Done
    
    style Start fill:#e1f5ff
    style Monitor fill:#fff4e1
    style SQLReport fill:#ffe1e1
    style PathReport fill:#ffe1e1
    style NetReport fill:#ffe1e1
    style CmdReport fill:#ffe1e1
    style DeserReport fill:#ffe1e1
    style ReportFinding fill:#ffe1e1
    style SaveInput fill:#ffe1e1
    style SQLPass fill:#e1ffe1
    style PathPass fill:#e1ffe1
    style NetPass fill:#e1ffe1
    style CmdPass fill:#e1ffe1
    style DeserPass fill:#e1ffe1
    style Continue fill:#e1ffe1
    style Done fill:#e1ffe1
